\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. See how great a flame aspires,
\par Kindled by a spark of grace !
\par Jesu's love the nations fires,
\par Sets the kingdoms on a blaze.
\par To bring fire on earth He came ;
\par Kindled in some hearts it is :
\par O that all might catch  the flame,
\par All partake the glorious bliss !
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When  He first the work begun,
\par Small and feeble was His day :
\par Now the word doth swiftly run,
\par Now it wins its widening way ;
\par More and more it spreads and grows
\par Ever mighty to prevail ;
\par Sin's  strongholds it now o'ertthrows,
\par Shakes the trembling gates of hell.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Sons of God, your Saviour praise !
\par He the door hath opened wide ;
\par He hath given the word of grace,
\par Jesu's word is glorified ;
\par Jesus, mighty to redeem,
\par He alone the work hath wrought ;
\par Worthy is the work of Him,
\par Him who spake a world from nought.
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Saw ye not the cloud arise,
\par Little as a human hand ? 
\par Now it spreads along the skies,
\par Hangs o'er all the thirsty land :
\par Lo ! the promise of a shower 
\par Drops already from above ;
\par But the Lord will shortly pour
\par All the Spirit of His love !
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

